      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T05:44:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`Name` stays the human readable label for the record, while `PlatformConfigName` is the short identifier a platform refers to and the device is named by on D-Bus, so folding them together would force a choice between a descriptive label and a short, stable name. That said, if you\u0027d still rather drop it, I\u0027m happy to take it off.",
